# Root-level scratch notes only (host_TOOLING_AND_DIRECTION.md,
# BENCHMARK_RESULTS.md, CLAUDE.local.md, SPARK_FLEET_VISION.md,
# rebuttal_and_analysis.md, todo.md). Markdown under docs/ and src/ is tracked.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/SETUP.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE.md

!*.xml
# But DO ignore extracted LIBERO benchmark XMLs (large generated data)
src/spark_bench/tasks/libero_scenes/*.xml
src/spark_bench/tasks/libero_scenes/*_state.json
!*.yaml

